  <h2>The app</h2>
  <p>If something doesn't work, you found a mistake in a timetable, or you have an idea, email us at <a href="mailto:kastoriadevcore@michadasis.com">kastoriadevcore@michadasis.com</a>.</p>
  <p>Tell us whether you have Android or an iPhone, the app's version (in Settings, under "About this app") and what happened.</p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>The app collects no personal data. See the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
